# sites.kzs -- logical sites of profile cfs-v7.0.1 (case R2) for the instrumented family (kzs-sites 2,
# kairos/docs/event_semantics.md section 3).  Configuration: the ENV tree, cFS bundle v7.0.1 (088b2fa8,
# env/build_cfs.sh), build native_std (-O0 -g).
# Stage D: every site of the F0 plan observe/sites.kzp (35) has a counterpart here with the same label, and an
# `equiv ... backends=f0,gcc-plugin status=unconfirmed` line that names the F0 site and how the two positions relate
# (IR section 9.3: a common name is not an equivalence; it is confirmed only with evidence, stage E).
#
# Positions follow the profile's linearization points (20_ops.kzp `lp at`) at the source statement: call(X) is the
# call of X (after-call where the profile's effect is done by X or reads its result, at-call where it reads the
# arguments), store(T.f) is the store statement, memset(T) is that memset call.  F0 approximated some of them (a
# return join it refuses, a store without a call on its line): the equiv refs say where.  Values are the operands the
# original code uses (arguments, results, stored values, the enclosing function's parameter values) and an out
# parameter read by the same thread right after a call (from=out<k>, event_semantics.md 8.1).  No string is copied.
# The F0 slot `return_address` has no counterpart (entry and return are paired by `link`).
#
# Not kept from the stage C manifest (instrument/gcc/sites/r2_v701.kzs): the callee-side store CFE_ES_GetAppID.store,
# which is not an F0 site and records every caller (selection plan section 4 item 6: narrowed to the caller side,
# sb_publication).  The SB call sites and sb_publication are points here (F0 meaning), not calls of the send function
# or of CFE_ES_GetAppID at the call site, so a call of the send function is not seen twice (once at its entry).
# Line numbers are those of the files at the revisions below.  Nothing here is a research condition.
kzs-sites 2
source cfs-bundle rev=088b2fa828db9ff7e00733f1908e0eeb59f66ce3 ref="env/build_cfs.sh BUNDLE_COMMIT (tag v7.0.1)"
source cfe rev=c5fb2b4d540bd55eb6c3707da7dd13eee679d4dd ref="env/build_cfs.sh PINNED_SUBMODULES"
source osal rev=d2d877a69cff47452bcca274b309147d48e6c16f ref="env/build_cfs.sh PINNED_SUBMODULES"
